Snake game
==========

Snake game is classic retro game. In this game, snake eats berries and grows. 

Made with C++ and Raylib library

C++ version 17
raylib v5.5

Quick start
===========

Download the releas packages of raylib from https://github.com/raysan5/raylib/releases

Setup raylib `inlude` and `lib` paths with your mingw (or any c/c++ compiler).

git clone https://github.com/MitkumarR/snake.git 

g++ .\src\main.cpp -lraylib -lopengl32 -lgdi32 -lwinmm -o snake

Enjoy snake game !!!

